# Everything under sft_data_inventory/ except the scripts + READMEs is
# auto-generated by ``build_inventory.py`` (symlinks back into ``labeling/``
# data dirs, per-task MANIFEST.json, and the rolled-up INVENTORY.json).
# These are reproducible from the canonical run paths configured at the top
# of build_inventory.py and should NOT be tracked.
INVENTORY.json
games/*/
non_game/*/
!games/README.md
!non_game/README.md
